# Every third RPDO1 of node 3 lost: an ordinary gap, never an integrity violation. The 15 RPDO1
# Lely sends during the commit count as matches, so the stream loses seqs 2, 5, 8, ...: seq 1 is
# kept, and the first actuation is 10 ms inside the command timeout after Enable Operation. The
# row streams with valid_until = now + 48 ms, so the previous command outlasts each lost update
# by 8 ms.
h2d 0x203/0x7FF every 3 offset 1 drop
